# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# Generated by build_runner, like the `*.g.dart` files the repository root
# already ignores. This app uses drift's *modular* generation (see
# build.yaml), which writes a `*.drift.dart` next to each table instead of one
# `database.g.dart` part — same output, different file names, so it gets the
# same treatment.
#
# The packages under `packages/` deliberately commit their `*.drift.dart` (a
# published package must build without build_runner). Delete these two lines
# if you would rather the example did the same; `dart run build_runner build`
# recreates everything either way.
*.drift.dart
